llowing probability mass function:\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{{4}^{x}{e}^{-4}}{x!}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the probability of finding $2$ typos on the next page is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X=2) & =f(2) \\\\  & =\\frac{{4}^{2}{e}^{-4}}{2!} \\\\  & ≈0.147\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nrounded to $3$ decimal places." 13194139534823 17592186045417 true] [17592186437111 1043 #edb/ref 17592186437140 13194139534823 17592186045417 true] [17592186437111 1043 #edb/ref 17592186437141 13194139534823 17592186045417 true] [17592186437111 1043 #edb/ref 17592186437142 13194139534823 17592186045417 true] [17592186437111 1043 #edb/ref 17592186437143 13194139534823 17592186045417 true] [17592186437111 1043 #edb/ref 17592186437144 13194139534823 17592186045417 true] [17592186437111 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534823 17592186045417 true] [17592186437111 1045 "Modeling With the Poisson Distribution" 13194139534823 17592186045417 true] [17592186437111 1046 #edb/ref 17592186437141 13194139534823 17592186045417 true] [17592186437111 1048 #edb/ref 17592186046658 13194139534823 17592186045417 true] [17592186437111 1049 #edb/ref 17592186048934 13194139534823 17592186045417 true] [17592186437111 1053 #uuid "6e3ee6dd-60a3-557f-8bd4-cac744c68b82" 13194139534823 17592186045417 true] [17592186437112 1080 "0.151" 13194139534823 17592186045417 true] [17592186437112 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534823 17592186045417 true] [17592186437112 1083 #uuid "0f9e78be-1c05-5746-af99-56ee649b8e69" 13194139534823 17592186045417 true] [17592186437113 1080 "0.132" 13194139534823 17592186045417 true] [17592186437113 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534823 17592186045417 true] [17592186437113 1083 #uuid "103af267-4448-5f1d-b2c7-5d3a6eb5caa1" 13194139534823 17592186045417 true] [17592186437114 1080 "0.907" 13194139534823 17592186045417 true] [17592186437114 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534823 17592186045417 true] [17592186437114 1083 #uuid "16527557-36e3-5765-85fe-85ad503bd10f" 13194139534823 17592186045417 true